:locale" content="en_US"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://ecomcircles.com/og-image.png"/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="Ecom Circles Dashboard"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Ecom Circles vs Bizmetrica (WAMP): Walmart Analytics"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Side-by-side comparison of Ecom Circles vs Bizmetrica / WAMP by SellerAmp. Walmart analytics, pricing, features, and which platform fits your seller business."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://ecomcircles.com/og-image.png"/><?php include __DIR__ . '/include/head-icons.php'; ?></head><body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans"><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><?php include __DIR__ . '/include/header.php'; ?><main class="pg-main"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://ecomcircles.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Compare","item":"https://ecomcircles.com/compare/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Bizmetrica","item":"https://ecomcircles.com/compare/bizmetrica/"}]}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Service","name":"Ecom Circles vs Bizmetrica (WAMP): Walmart Analytics","description":"Side-by-side comparison of Ecom Circles vs Bizmetrica / WAMP by SellerAmp. Walmart analytics, pricing, features, and which platform fits your seller business.","url":"https://ecomcircles.com/compare/bizmetrica/","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Ecom Circles","url":"https://ecomcircles.com"}}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":"Ecom Circles vs Bizmetrica"}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Bizmetrica / WAMP worth it for Walmart sellers?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, if you sell exclusively on Walmart. WAMP (the SellerAmp-powered successor to Bizmetrica) is currently free in beta with four core modules: Historic Charts, Profit Calculator, Buy Box Analysis, and Badges Panel. Hard to beat on price. But if you sell on Amazon or Mirakl too, Ecom Circles is the better fit."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happened to Bizmetrica?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"SellerAmp acquired Bizmetrica in September 2025 and launched WAMP (wamp.com), a rebuilt version combining SellerAmp's analytics engine with Bizmetrica's historical Walmart data. WAMP is currently in free beta. Post-launch pricing hasn't been announced yet."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use Bizmetrica for repricer automation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Bizmetrica is research + analytics only. No repricing, no inventory sync, no 3PL integration. Ecom Circles does all three."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Ecom Circles have the same analytics as Bizmetrica?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Similar. Ecom Circles covers ~50M Walmart items with price history, estimated sales, and trends. Ecom Circles also adds Amazon research, repricing automation, and full operations. Bizmetrica stops at research."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What about the Bizmetrica community?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Bizmetrica includes a private Facebook group + Walmart selling course. Ecom Circles doesn't have community yet, but has direct support via email + chat."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I import Bizmetrica data into Ecom Circles?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not directly. But you can use both. Use Bizmetrica for deep Walmart research, Ecom Circles for multi-channel operations. Or use only Ecom Circles and skip the second tool."}}]}</script><section class="pgx-33 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-34"><div class="pgx-35"><h1 class="pgx-36 font-satoshi">Ecom Circles vs Bizmetrica (WAMP): Walmart Research vs Operations</h1><p class="pgx-37">Bizmetrica is now WAMP by SellerAmp. Walmart analytics vs full-featured SaaS. Understand the difference and pick the right one.</p><div class="pgx-38"><a class="pgx-39" href="#features">See Feature Matrix<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-3 lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="pgx-40" href="pricing.php">View Pricing</a></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-41 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-42"><p class="pgx-43">Bizmetrica was a focused Walmart research tool: price trends, sales estimates, and competitor moves. In September 2025, SellerAmp acquired Bizmetrica and launched WAMP (wamp.com), a rebuilt version combining SellerAmp&#x27;s analytics engine with Bizmetrica&#x27;s historical Walmart data. WAMP is currently free while in beta, with paid pricing coming later. It covers four core modules: Historic Charts, Profit Calculator, Buy Box Analysis, and Badges Panel. If you only need Walmart research, WAMP is hard to beat on price right now. But if you sell on multiple channels, need to automate repricing, manage orders, or integrate with warehouses, research tools stop where operations begin. That&#x27;s where Ecom Circles picks up.</p></div></section><section class="pgx-49 bg-shades" id="features"><div class="pgx-34"><div class="pgx-50"><h2 class="pgx-51 font-satoshi">Feature-by-Feature Comparison</h2></div><div class="pgx-302"><table class="pgx-76 pgx-663"><thead><tr class="pgx-303"><th class="pgx-304">Feature</th><th class="pgx-304">Bizmetrica</th><th class="pgx-304">Ecom Circles</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Walmart Product Research</td><td class="pgx-307">✓</td><td class="pgx-308">✓</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Amazon Product Research</td><td class="pgx-307">✗</td><td class="pgx-308">✓</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Price History Charts</td><td class="pgx-307">✓ (1B+ data points)</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ (~50M items)</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Estimated Sales Volume</td><td class="pgx-307">✓</td><td class="pgx-308">✓</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Competitor Inventory Tracking</td><td class="pgx-307">✓</td><td class="pgx-308">Limited</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Competitor Discovery</td><td class="pgx-307">✓</td><td class="pgx-308">✓</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Repricing Automation</td><td class="pgx-307">✗</td><td class="pgx-308">✓</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Order Management</td><td class="pgx-307">✗</td><td class="pgx-308">✓</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Inventory Sync</td><td class="pgx-307">✗</td><td class="pgx-308">✓</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Wholesale Sourcing</td><td class="pgx-307">✗</td><td class="pgx-308">✓</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">3PL/Warehouse Integration</td><td class="pgx-307">✗</td><td class="pgx-308">✓</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Mirakl Support</td><td class="pgx-307">✗</td><td class="pgx-308">✓</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Chrome Extension</td><td class="pgx-307">✓</td><td class="pgx-308">✓</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Community/Course</td><td class="pgx-307">✓ (FB + course)</td><td class="pgx-308">✗</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Multi-Channel Support</td><td class="pgx-307">Walmart only</td><td class="pgx-308">Amazon + Walmart + Mirakl</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Starting Price</td><td class="pgx-307">Free (beta) / $19.99 post-launch</td><td class="pgx-308">$27/mo</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Free Trial</td><td class="pgx-307">Free beta (no CC)</td><td class="pgx-308">14 days (CC required)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class="pgx-57 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-34"><div class="pgx-50"><h2 class="pgx-51 font-satoshi">Why Sellers Choose Ecom Circles Over Bizmetrica</h2></div><div class="pgx-310"><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Multi-Channel Support</h3><p class="pgx-1">Sell on Amazon, Walmart, and Mirakl? Bizmetrica only covers Walmart. Ecom Circles manages all three from one dashboard.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Repricer Automation</h3><p class="pgx-1">Research is half the battle. Bizmetrica finds opportunities, but you&#x27;re manually repricing. Ecom Circles automates it 24/7.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Order &amp; Inventory Ops</h3><p class="pgx-1">Bizmetrica is analytics-only. Ecom Circles syncs orders automatically, manages inventory across warehouses, tracks stock levels.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Wholesale Sourcing</h3><p class="pgx-1">Can&#x27;t scale manually. Ecom Circles integrates wholesale sourcing so you can find and restock profitable items efficiently.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Warehouse &amp; 3PL</h3><p class="pgx-1">Selling at scale means you need fulfillment partners. Ecom Circles integrates with 3PL systems; Bizmetrica doesn&#x27;t.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">One Platform, One Bill</h3><p class="pgx-1">Use Bizmetrica for research, then buy a separate repricer, order tool, and inventory system. Or use Ecom Circles for everything.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-49 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-42"><h2 class="pgx-311 font-satoshi">When Bizmetrica Makes Sense</h2><div class="pgx-24"><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Walmart-Only Seller, Just Starting</h3><p class="pgx-1">Bizmetrica at $19.99/mo is perfect. Test the niche, validate demand, learn Walmart trends. No credit card required to try.</p></div><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Deep Walmart Research, No Plans to Scale</h3><p class="pgx-1">Bizmetrica is built for this. Price history, competitor tracking, sales estimates. Everything you need for tactical decisions.</p></div><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Budget-Conscious Researcher</h3><p class="pgx-1">Bizmetrica is the cheapest entry point for Walmart data. Good for side hustlers or testing new categories.</p></div><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Multi-Channel Seller Wanting Only Walmart Analytics</h3><p class="pgx-1">You could use Bizmetrica alongside another platform. But Ecom Circles does the same research + full operations in one.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-57 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-42"><h2 class="pgx-311 font-satoshi">Bizmetrica vs Ecom Circles FAQs</h2><div><div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">Is Bizmetrica / WAMP worth it for Walmart sellers?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pg-faq__chev" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">What happened to Bizmetrica?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pg-faq__chev" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg